        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were discarded the moment you drew your first breath. Weak, useless, nothing but a statistical failure. Thrown into an abyss… The end of the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you survived.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb through <strong>cursed</strong> paths toward the <strong>malevolent</strong> peak, where, so they say, something incredible awaits. No one has ever made it that far.<br>And yet… you keep jumping.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One single action:</strong> Jump. Every leap is designed to look easy. It never is.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique atmosphere:</strong> Sounds and visuals crafted to disguise the hell that awaits you.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless playtime:</strong> From 2 hours to 2 years, depending on the instability of the path… and the stubbornness of the climber.</p></li></ul>",
